<title>INDIA: India's Escorts 1996/97 net rises.</title>
<headline>India's Escorts 1996/97 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	   1,272.2  vs  1,003.8</p>
<p>    Gross sales	 15,002.0  vs 13,036.8</p>
<p>    shr (rupee)	     19.52 vs     16.90</p>
<p>    Div (pct)		 45.0  vs     40.0</p>
<p>    Other income	 1,572.9  vs  1,403.3</p>
<p>    Total expenditure 12,939.2  vs 11,240.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   300.8  vs    307.8</p>
<p>    Tax			400.0  vs    385.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Indian tractor and motorcycle maker Escorts Ltd released the results in a statement. Other income includes income from extraordinary items amounting to 818.6 million rupees.</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
